---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL } from "../lib/site";
---

<LegalPage
  title="License and upstream attribution — Solla Code"
  description="Source license and project identity for the Solla Code fork."
  heading="License and upstream attribution"
  lede="Source license and project identity for the Solla Code fork."
  lastUpdated="2026-09-04"
  sections={[
    ["license", "Source license"],
    ["upstream", "Upstream services"],
    ["assets", "Design and media"],
  ]}
>
  <section id="license">
    <p class="section-number">01</p>
    <h2>Source license</h2>
    <p>
      Solla Code is an independently maintained fork of T3 Code. The source is
      distributed under the repository's <a
        href={`${GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}/blob/main/LICENSE`}>MIT License</a
      >, including its copyright and warranty notices. The original T3 Tools
      copyright notice is preserved.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="upstream">
    <p class="section-number">02</p>
    <h2>Upstream services</h2>
    <p>
      Solla Code is not operated by T3 Tools. Upstream hosted services and
      provider accounts have their own operators and terms. This page does not
      create a service agreement with T3 Tools or describe this fork as an
      official T3 distribution.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="assets">
    <p class="section-number">03</p>
    <h2>Design and media</h2>
    <p>
      The gold S is based on the owner's Blender model. Its lighting and
      materials, the website graphics, and the film's electronic score are
      constructed in code. Interface footage records the production Solla client
      with illustrative project content.
    </p>
    <p>
      DM Sans is used under the <a href="/fonts/OFL-DM-Sans.txt"
        >SIL Open Font License</a
      >. The <a
        href={`${GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}/blob/main/tools/motion/README.md`}
        >media workflow</a
      > documents the source assets, production tools, and recording boundaries.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
